Android Open Source Project Java framework

This product includes the uninstrumented Android 16 Java framework implementation
from org.robolectric:android-all:16-robolectric-13921718, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The publisher artifact identity is recorded in provenance.json.

Framework methods and native declarations are retained. Exact JVM/libcore
portability call sites are normalized at build time; mappings and their origins
are listed in ../robolectric-portability/source.json. The publisher's matching
macOS ARM64 libandroid_runtime.dylib is retained unchanged and registers the
NativeAllocationRegistry native free callback on demand. Its archive entry,
size and checksum are recorded in provenance.json. Other native binaries and
java.* classes owned by the host JDK are omitted. Listed overrides connect platform
operations to the MacLauncher Klepton host. No Robolectric device or service shadows are included.

The framework artifact includes the original Android org.json classes.
